Package: kernora-archive
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 debian-archive-keyring,
 unattended-upgrades
Description: Kernora OS package archives and updates
 Sets up APT for Kernora OS: the Debian archive with its security updates,
 the Kernora package archive and its signing key, and a preference for
 Kernora's own builds over Debian packages of the same name.
 .
 Security updates from Debian, kernel updates among them, and LibreWolf
 updates are installed automatically once a day. Other updates are offered
 in Settings > Updates. Nothing is updated in the live session.
